# Build context for deploy/docker/Dockerfile (docs/container.md): only what
# the flow-server build and the image need. Everything else (apps, docs,
# models, target/, .git) stays out of the context.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!VERSION
!crates/
!deploy/docker/
!docs/air-gapped-models.txt
crates/**/target/
deploy/docker/prebuilt/.gitignore
